<Base title="Privacy Policy | CupToGram" description="How CupToGram handles calculator inputs, hosting data, and future advertising." path="/privacy/"><main class="wrap content"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Last updated: October 18, 2026</p><p>CupToGram is designed to work without accounts or a site-owned database. Calculator inputs are processed in your browser and are not submitted to a CupToGram application server.</p><h2>Hosting and technical data</h2><p>The website is hosted using Cloudflare. The hosting provider may process technical request data, such as IP address, browser details, and request information, to deliver, secure, and troubleshoot the service. Cloudflare Web Analytics may be used if enabled; it is configured separately from the conversion calculator.</p><h2>Advertising</h2><p>CupToGram does not currently display advertisements. If Google AdSense or another advertising service is enabled in the future, this policy will be updated before ads are displayed to explain the relevant data use, cookies or similar technologies, and available privacy or consent choices. Advertising services may process information according to their own policies and applicable laws.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can manage cookies and site data through your browser settings. If advertising or analytics services are added, links to the relevant provider privacy settings and any required consent controls will be provided where applicable.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions or requests, email <a href="mailto:lucidpoverty@gmail.com">lucidpoverty@gmail.com</a>.</p></main></Base>